  "question": "Let $a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_{11}$ be an arbitrary arrangement (i.e., permutation) of the integers $1,2,\\ldots,11$. Then the number $(a_1-1)(a_2-2)\\cdots(a_{11}-11)$ is",
